## Validation and preservation

The absolute owning executable ran once from `/tmp` after final additions and before commit. Outer exit was 0. Stderr was empty. All 56 actual outcomes matched expected exits: 21 successful commands and 35 expected refusals.

Execution started at `2026-11-27T00:11:21.256766+00:00` and took 9.079340 seconds. This is precommit evidence, not a postcommit execution claim. Executed runtime and final authored documents equal the final committed blobs.

Full updated references were read through MQ. Manual inspection covered purpose, primary reader, human document date, labelled vertical lists, short sentences and local referrals. No permanent wording tests were added.

Protected runtime, runner, manifest, catalog, SKILL and style-selection bytes equal `dab2338e6be69e208c39c6c05164c0a1a066dbf7`. All five assets match frozen source and parent checksums. Catalog nonidentity bytes, ordered associations, provenance and capture time match the parent numeric baseline. Existing reference bodies remain unchanged outside exact opener insertion.

